# The app's runtime data directory, guarded here rather than in the root ignore file (the same rule
# the other apps have there). Umbrel rsyncs this tree into `app-data` at install (dropping the
# .gitkeep files), which is how the bind-mount source exists and is owned by the right uid before
# the container first starts.
#
# The DIRECTORIES are tracked, through their .gitkeep files. Nothing else under here ever may be:
# on a machine that has actually run the app it holds the workshop's data. This repository is
# public.
data/**
!data/**/
!data/**/.gitkeep
